{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the hyperspace trade lanes in <i>Hyperspace Hub Manager</i>, a sci-fi economy sim where your Ecumenopolis thrives or crumbles by your choices. Set tariffs on five exotic resources\u2014Aetheric Plasma, Biogenic Spores, Synthomorph Nanites, Neutronium Crystals, and Void Tendrils\u2014balancing credits, happiness, and anarchy in real-time. Guide autonomous city growth through strategic policies, fend off cunning smugglers, and support projects to shape your hub\u2019s destiny. Witness a living Ecumenopolis evolve across three stages, from fledgling outpost to galactic hub, with victory secured through masterful trade tactics. Perfect for casual strategists seeking deep, accessible fun in a vibrant, thematic world. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897850?t=1754966251","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897850?t=1754966251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897850/e14c8ef75c2279b1255223c25f4e8575de9f6435/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754966251","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897850/e14c8ef75c2279b1255223c25f4e8575de9f6435/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754966251","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the hyperspace trade lanes in <i>Hyperspace Hub Manager</i>, a sci-fi economy sim where your Ecumenopolis thrives or crumbles by your choices. Set tariffs on five exotic resources\u2014Aetheric Plasma, Biogenic Spores, Synthomorph Nanites, Neutronium Crystals, and Void Tendrils\u2014balancing credits, happiness, and anarchy in real-time. Guide autonomous city growth through strategic policies, fend off cunning smugglers, and support projects to shape your hub\u2019s destiny. Witness a living Ecumenopolis evolve across three stages, from fledgling outpost to galactic hub, with victory secured through masterful trade tactics. Perfect for casual strategists seeking deep, accessible fun in a vibrant, thematic world. </p>","developers":["Uncanny Mercantile"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897850/38dbfe5cc5a77d2cb8cf669636aa03739d957bf3/header.jpg?t=1754966251","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897850/1177488590/d19b04a6c52aeda602865f867c46912e977a8dd5/1753306620/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753560454","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897850/1177488590/d19b04a6c52aeda602865f867c46912e977a8dd5/1753306620/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753560454","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897850/1177488590/d19b04a6c52aeda602865f867c46912e977a8dd5/1753306620/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753560454","id":257173092,"name":"Hyperspace Hub Manager","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173092/12db74109ee28e15a8530796e15056e2c0e29735/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753560454"}],"name":"Hyperspace Hub Manager","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Hyperspace Hub Manager - $0.99 USD","packageid":1370033,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":99}],"title":"Buy Hyperspace Hub Manager"}],"packages":[1370033],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD F